        <mxCell id="notes" value="REQUEST PATHS&#xa;1. Ledger import (admin): backup modal → POST /api/ledger/backup/import (dry_run) → requireAdmin → parse and plan → snapshot → Supabase sync if configured → commit ledger file&#xa;2. Ledger export (admin): backup modal → GET /api/ledger/backup/export → requireAdmin → ledgerService → SQL, JSON or CSV&#xa;3. Live guest chat: chat widget → Socket.io chat:message → chatbot.js → staff:customer_handoff → staff_agents room&#xa;4. Protected page load: route guard → session token → edge middleware → authenticate → REST or GraphQL → Supabase or local data&#xa;&#xa;BOOT SEQUENCE&#xa;env.js → security middleware chain → bootstrapFramework(app) → http or https server + attachChatbot → listen on PORT (default 4000) → startSchemaCollector(60000)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingTop=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0B1120;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5E0EA;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1056" width="1610" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
